# Code owners.
#
# Everyone listed here is requested for review automatically on a pull request
# touching the matching paths. This file assigns review, not permission — it
# cannot stop a merge on its own. Enforcement is a branch protection rule
# requiring review from a code owner, which has to be configured on the
# repository separately; without that rule this file is a convenience.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all goes first and the narrower
# rules below override it.

* @grabdoc

# The release pipeline, the gate, and the licence and third-party notices.
# These decide what is published and under what terms, and a mistake in any of
# them reaches Maven Central, where a release can be superseded but never
# withdrawn. They are called out so a change here is never reviewed as an
# ordinary file change.

/.github/workflows/  @grabdoc
/LICENSE             @grabdoc
/NOTICE              @grabdoc
/pom.xml             @grabdoc
